    {
      "id": "gitlab-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 442,
      "y": 448.125,
      "width": 676,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172554",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821412062,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 809507411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "GitLab — per allowlisted project / branch / environment\n\n• Merged MRs updated after window start; retain created + merged events\n• Commits since/until; inspect diffs for up to 5 commits, only relevantPaths\n• Parent + child pipelines updated within the window (paginated)\n• Deployments filtered by configured environments and exact window\n• Failed pipelines first; query failed current jobs, failed retry history,\n  then canceled jobs; collapse retry families and rank earliest hard failure\n• Read bounded useful trace tails for selected failed job families\n\nProduces change, pipeline, failed-step, deployment and code-reference evidence.",
      "rawText": "GitLab — per allowlisted project / branch / environment\n\n• Merged MRs updated after window start; retain created + merged events\n• Commits since/until; inspect diffs for up to 5 commits, only relevantPaths\n• Parent + child pipelines updated within the window (paginated)\n• Deployments filtered by configured environments and exact window\n• Failed pipelines first; query failed current jobs, failed retry history,\n  then canceled jobs; collapse retry families and rank earliest hard failure\n• Read bounded useful trace tails for selected failed job families\n\nProduces change, pipeline, failed-step, deployment and code-reference evidence.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gitlab",
      "originalText": "GitLab — per allowlisted project / branch / environment\n\n• Merged MRs updated after window start; retain created + merged events\n• Commits since/until; inspect diffs for up to 5 commits, only relevantPaths\n• Parent + child pipelines updated within the window (paginated)\n• Deployments filtered by configured environments and exact window\n• Failed pipelines first; query failed current jobs, failed retry history,\n  then canceled jobs; collapse retry families and rank earliest hard failure\n• Read bounded useful trace tails for selected failed job families\n\nProduces change, pipeline, failed-step, deployment and code-reference evidence.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
