    {
      "id": "nomad-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1182,
      "y": 452.5,
      "width": 686,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172554",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1649484360,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2105266625,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Nomad — only allowlisted namespace / job pairs\n\n1. GET job state for every selected job before larger detail calls\n2. GET allocations?all=true; retain non-running/non-complete allocations\n3. GET deployments; flag non-successful state\n4. GET evaluations; flag non-complete state\n\nRequests include configured region + namespace. The Nomad token uses\nX-Nomad-Token. Primary job state is protected from a noisy job exhausting\nthe shared byte budget.",
      "rawText": "Nomad — only allowlisted namespace / job pairs\n\n1. GET job state for every selected job before larger detail calls\n2. GET allocations?all=true; retain non-running/non-complete allocations\n3. GET deployments; flag non-successful state\n4. GET evaluations; flag non-complete state\n\nRequests include configured region + namespace. The Nomad token uses\nX-Nomad-Token. Primary job state is protected from a noisy job exhausting\nthe shared byte budget.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "nomad",
      "originalText": "Nomad — only allowlisted namespace / job pairs\n\n1. GET job state for every selected job before larger detail calls\n2. GET allocations?all=true; retain non-running/non-complete allocations\n3. GET deployments; flag non-successful state\n4. GET evaluations; flag non-complete state\n\nRequests include configured region + namespace. The Nomad token uses\nX-Nomad-Token. Primary job state is protected from a noisy job exhausting\nthe shared byte budget.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
