      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Grafana\n\n• Build dashboard and panel links for the exact time window\n• GET annotations filtered by configured tags, from/to and item limit\n• Render safe label templates into each configured datasource query\n• POST /api/ds/query with 15s interval and max 240 data points\n• Extract numeric values; compare maximum with warningAbove\n\nProduces annotation timeline events and metric snapshot findings.",
      "rawText": "Grafana\n\n• Build dashboard and panel links for the exact time window\n• GET annotations filtered by configured tags, from/to and item limit\n• Render safe label templates into each configured datasource query\n• POST /api/ds/query with 15s interval and max 240 data points\n• Extract numeric values; compare maximum with warningAbove\n\nProduces annotation timeline events and metric snapshot findings.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "grafana",
      "originalText": "Grafana\n\n• Build dashboard and panel links for the exact time window\n• GET annotations filtered by configured tags, from/to and item limit\n• Render safe label templates into each configured datasource query\n• POST /api/ds/query with 15s interval and max 240 data points\n• Extract numeric values; compare maximum with warningAbove\n\nProduces annotation timeline events and metric snapshot findings.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
